<title>UK: Euromarket turnover rose in week to Nov 21 -ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover rose in week to Nov 21 -ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets rose to $1.689 trillion in the week to November 21 from $933.6 billion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     56.42		49.96</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     28.23		23.18</p>
<p> Secondary market:		  927.94	     883.67</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    195.10	     162.01</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	705.22	     645.06</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    279.14	     288.56</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
